          "url": "https://documenter.getpostman.com/view/18545278/UVJbJdKh"
        },
        "description": "Arbeitnow helps companies hire candidates with visa sponsorship / four day work week / remote opportunities.",
        "servers": [
          {
            "description": "Production server",
            "url": "https://www.arbeitnow.com/api"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Arbeitnow",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "tagline": "Browse English-speaking job listings across Germany with visa sponsorship, remote, and four-day-week filters",
        "homepage": "https://www.arbeitnow.com/",
        "docs_url": "https://www.arbeitnow.com/api/job-board-api",
        "license_short": "Public job-board feed; check Arbeitnow's site for terms before redistributing listings.",
        "license_md": "- No explicit open licence is published with the API\n- Job listings are sourced from Arbeitnow's public board and may carry employer-specific terms\n- Attribution and a link back to arbeitnow.com is the typical expectation for republished postings\n- Confirm current terms at [arbeitnow.com](https://www.arbeitnow.com/) before redistributing data",
        "about_md": "[Arbeitnow](https://www.arbeitnow.com/) is a Berlin-based job board focused on opportunities in Germany and Europe that don't require German-language skills. The site highlights roles offering visa sponsorship, remote work, and four-day work weeks, and exposes the same listings through a public Job Board API.\n\nWhat you get from the API:\n\n- A feed of currently open job postings aggregated by Arbeitnow\n- Listings annotated with tags such as visa sponsorship, remote, and four-day-week\n- Company, location, and posting metadata suitable for building job boards, aggregators, or analytics\n\nThe API is served from `https://www.arbeitnow.com/api` and the primary route documented is `GET /api/job-board-api`. CORS is enabled and no authentication key is advertised for the public board endpoint, so it can be consumed directly from browser and server clients alike.",
        "entity_desc": {
          "job": "An open job posting from the Arbeitnow board, fetched via `GET /api/job-board-api`, typically including title, company, location, tags (visa, remote, four-day-week), and a link back to the listing."
        },
